# --- canvas palette (D5): one selector per schematic layer and theme; layer 0 is the background.
# The app reads `fg` of `canvas.<theme>.<layer>`, `.grid` and `.sel`. Dark = xschem's dark scheme
# as captured; light = inventory §4A.3 for layers 0-5, the rest read off 60_main_light.png or
# darkened from the dark list for contrast on white. -----------------------------------------------

